{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "a8f815e4b976557aed3cd7130b885e855c987c4e1bf0e1cbda0ee5f93db0bc90", "ja": "おお～。ひらひら～……ふわふわ～……。\nむふふ♪", "zh": "哦～飘飘的～……软绵绵的～……\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1423c451dc72f549c35aec29f627c430a94331310143a7438c1df31b6327a1d3", "ja": "おっ。新しい衣装、似合ってるじゃないか。\n美也も気に入ってくれたみたいだな。", "zh": "哦，新服装很适合你嘛。\n美也好像也很喜欢呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "ff770e8a169a2e64cc3c4b5f2077eecc0714f869ca22a8eb1d4b0a5124a10179", "ja": "はい～。この衣装、かわいいだけじゃなくて、\n着心地もとってもいいんですよ～。", "zh": "是呀～这套服装不光可爱，穿起来也特别舒服呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1003_042miy", "source_sha256": "84551ea74cb628d4873ca2294ee7384b47f4640ecca12ffa61a089de15c5624e", "ja": "それに、心がウキウキしてきて……\nなんだか幸せな気分になるんです～。", "zh": "而且，心情也变得雀跃起来……不知怎么的，感觉好幸福呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a02b89677ac7f32432340dde71cd4620f9537721a017c5674be6f172dafa19f4", "ja": "喜んでくれてよかった。幸せな美也を見ていると、\nこっちまで幸せな気持ちになってくるよ。", "zh": "你开心就好。看着幸福的美也，\n连我也觉得幸福起来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "7c999deb3231609d3137d55b371e170a3fe02a7fb552845123e4b68fff55eae8", "ja": "むふふっ。私の幸せをおすそわけできたみたいで、\nうれしいです～。あ……そうだ。", "zh": "唔呼呼。看来我也把自己的幸福分给你了，\n真开心呀～。啊……对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1006_042miy", "source_sha256": "318d7731b182fbd40dfc92ad134458c47e4687891042589d06e696b82dda9f04", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n今から一緒に、お散歩に行きませんか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n现在要不要和我一起去散个步呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1007_p", "source_sha256": "73a91bb020866ac4ae5c78eb55bf04b5318bc1cf8924b309ca6f5d99da7d8f91", "ja": "お散歩……？　今からか？", "zh": "散步……？现在就去吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "5c4be4872a10d11bfd4f5bfd63818165dbc123d25c14a21fbcc038dfe825af61", "ja": "はい～。この衣装でお散歩をしたら、\nきっと、もっと幸せな気持ちになれると思って……。", "zh": "是的～。我觉得穿着这身服装去散步的话，一定能感受到更多幸福……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "0a21aedd9532eb82de4160d8015f9ee6c1c81adfc954c551e192bec74d45b129", "ja": "それと、私の幸せな気持ちを、\nお散歩で出会った人達に、おすそわけしたいなって。", "zh": "还有，我想把这份幸福的心情，通过散步分享给途中遇到的人们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "a2a591b8485791ae8314e2257972015a70f14e9bd05e8c4c8d9de85a3a5c58f8", "ja": "あっ。もしかして、{$P$}さん……\n忙しかったですか～？", "zh": "啊。难道说，{$P$}先生……\n现在很忙吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1011_p", "source_sha256": "81355f81caa5fbaecd447d208d587c3bd51ae5a4f15543ad8d42c1c5b04df4ac", "ja": "いや、時間は大丈夫だけど……。なあ、美也？\nその衣装で外に出るのは、また今度にしないか？", "zh": "不是，时间倒是没问题……对吧，美也？\n要不下次再穿着那套服装出门？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8a3ce4ed6da2efa26b93b5af9549707f16f17f288d8b703bb9c5ca32062e2612", "ja": "もし衣装が汚れたら、きっとがっかりする。\n美也の幸せな気持ちが台無しになっちゃうと思うんだ。", "zh": "要是把服装弄脏了，你一定会很沮丧的。\n美也这份幸福的心情，也会被彻底毁掉的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "2a123c1fb49fa3e55727a7285da133e0f8ab503a2f5a6e6e36a54f79b784b1ae", "ja": "なるほど～……。{$P$}さんが\nそう言うなら、仕方ありませんね～。", "zh": "这样啊～……既然{$P$}先生这么说，那也没办法呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "152d4f3ba098fbe57ced9ebb70b9836ad714cf6e870d3b232953f0a90e784025", "ja": "ではお外がダメなら、\n劇場の中をお散歩するというのは、どうでしょうか～？", "zh": "那么，如果不能去外面，\n在剧场里面散散步怎么样呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1015_p", "source_sha256": "b9a18aa53702bfd30cd128d8fcf0c613454588510453e2e3c5c3bd353b9ae704", "ja": "劇場の中……。\nまあ、それなら大丈夫かな。", "zh": "剧场里面……  \n嗯，那样的话应该没问题吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "fb3704cff323512925e5537ce74e6fdbca4cb77cf7e60c509a149f1daf7e5367", "ja": "本当ですか～？　ふふっ、よかった。衣装のまま\n劇場をお散歩するなんて、なんだか新鮮ですな～。", "zh": "真的吗～？呵呵，那太好了。穿着演出服在剧场里散步，总觉得很新鲜呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e89cf1974b526eab324de29289beb2dbd616d01e131c7978610f9c84463e0cfb", "ja": "ははっ、そうだな。\nいつもと違う散歩になりそうで楽しみだよ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。感觉会是一次与平时不同的散步，我很期待。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1018_042miy", "source_sha256": "828637eebaed05b6d15aa2a548d2c41579bf75938e42c2c2e890759a6f101921", "ja": "はい～。私もドキドキしてます。それでは\n{$P$}さん、お散歩に行きましょ～。", "zh": "好的～我也很期待呢。那么，{$P$}先生，我们去散步吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_042miy0334_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_042miy0334_1019_042miy", "source_sha256": "6514178b81639913cb06af7fd0efc79f5ae61ccc9a6b15eb20f15c234e253e7e", "ja": "{$P$}さんと一緒なら、\nとっても幸せな時間になりそうですね～。むふふ♪", "zh": "要是能和{$P$}先生在一起，\n感觉会是一段非常幸福的时光呢～。呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
